// ctxc's reader and printer for the typed IR: `ctxc roundtrip` of a program's IR (`ctxc ir`)
// gives the same text back, with its strings' escapes, its bytes, floats, a negative i64 and
// an optional.
//# build text: {home}/tests/helpers/text.ctx

//# $ {text} to p.ir {ctxc} ir {std} -- main.ctx
//# exit: 0
//# $ {text} to q.ir {ctxc} roundtrip p.ir
//# exit: 0
//# $ {text} same p.ir q.ir
//# stdout:
//| same
